          <a href="/vote" class="ag-mega__item"><span class="ag-mega__ico" style="background:#effaf0;color:#237b22">✓</span><span class="ag-mega__txt"><strong>Vote</strong><small>One verified voter, one vote per category</small></span></a>
          <a href="/account/register" class="ag-mega__item"><span class="ag-mega__ico" style="background:#fff8df;color:#7a5600">✦</span><span class="ag-mega__txt"><strong>Create an account</strong><small>Free — earn voting points and redeem them for votes</small></span></a>
